# An agent asks with an options card (e2e/fake/claude.mjs `card:`): its options under its words, the one it recommends
# marked; one tapped answers it (decision.answer): the viewer's message quoting the post, the card saying how it went.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
tap 发消息
type 给我几个选项 {T} card:要不要换图标 {T}|先不换 {T}|一起换 {T}*|不用了 {T}!
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
until =一起换 {T}
shot 1-card
tap =一起换 {T}
until 选择了
gone =先不换 {T}
shot 2-answered
